{"parse": {"title": "第三扇门", "pageid": 89281, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"preamble\" style=\"--preamble-text-shadow: #FAE690\">\n    <div class=\"preamble-background\"></div>\n    <div class=\"preamble-content\"><p>“暴雨”冲刷下残存的痕迹，偶尔也能</p><p>见到误入此地的神秘学生物，抑或被遗留在此的物件。</p><p>司辰将漫步其中，探寻灰尘中的故事。</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; border: solid 1px #ec5d00; display: inline-block; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 1px; background-color: #00000050;\"><b>活动时间：</b>常驻<br /> <b>开启条件：</b>完成<a href=\"/wiki/5TH-03\" title=\"5TH-03\">5TH-03</a>小径</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E7.8E.A9.E6.B3.95.E4.BB.8B.E7.BB.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"玩法介绍\">玩法介绍</span></h2>\n<p>第三扇门是一个以探索为主、战斗为辅的全新常驻玩法，司辰可以在特定的房间内自由行动，收集道具，触发机关，挑战魔精，了解曾在此处发生的故事，并根据完成度获得对应的奖励。每期“第三扇门”将围绕一个主题展开探索，一般一个主题有三个关卡，玩家于地图中探索可拾取珍藏获得奖励，并通过收集“往日隐迹”解锁故事。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.85.B3.E5.8D.A1.E4.BF.A1.E6.81.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"关卡信息\">关卡信息</span></h2>\n<div class=\"infopad\" style=\"border-color:#ec5d00; background-color: #00000050;\">关卡剧情内容因探索顺序不同，可能会有所出入。</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>系列</th>\n<th>关卡</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>剧情<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">&#91;1&#93;</a></sup>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">阿勒夫克姆遗闻\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>01</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>弃子<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">The Gambit</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E9%98%BF%E5%8B%92%E5%A4%AB%E5%85%8B%E5%A7%86%E9%81%97%E9%97%BB/%E5%BC%83%E5%AD%90\" title=\"第三扇门/阿勒夫克姆遗闻/弃子\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>02</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>钩与饵<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">The Bait and the Prey</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E9%98%BF%E5%8B%92%E5%A4%AB%E5%85%8B%E5%A7%86%E9%81%97%E9%97%BB/%E9%92%A9%E4%B8%8E%E9%A5%B5\" title=\"第三扇门/阿勒夫克姆遗闻/钩与饵\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>03</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>通往新世界<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">To the Brand New World</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E9%98%BF%E5%8B%92%E5%A4%AB%E5%85%8B%E5%A7%86%E9%81%97%E9%97%BB/%E9%80%9A%E5%BE%80%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C\" title=\"第三扇门/阿勒夫克姆遗闻/通往新世界\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">轮齿之史\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>01</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>再见绿草杆儿<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">See You, Little Tree Branch</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2/%E5%86%8D%E8%A7%81%E7%BB%BF%E8%8D%89%E6%9D%86%E5%84%BF\" title=\"第三扇门/轮齿之史/再见绿草杆儿\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>02</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>血锈的齿轮<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Gears With Blood</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2/%E8%A1%80%E9%94%88%E7%9A%84%E9%BD%BF%E8%BD%AE\" title=\"第三扇门/轮齿之史/血锈的齿轮\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>03</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>往日将逝<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">The Past Will Be Past</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2/%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%86%E9%80%9D\" title=\"第三扇门/轮齿之史/往日将逝\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">尘灰以下\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>01</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>立足点<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">New Foothold</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B/%E7%AB%8B%E8%B6%B3%E7%82%B9\" title=\"第三扇门/尘灰以下/立足点\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>02</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>岔路口<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Fork in the Road</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B/%E5%B2%94%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%A3\" title=\"第三扇门/尘灰以下/岔路口\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>03</b></span>\n</td>\n<td>永没尘寰<br /> <small style=\"color: #999;\">Buried in the Dirt</small></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B/%E6%B0%B8%E6%B2%A1%E5%B0%98%E5%AF%B0\" title=\"第三扇门/尘灰以下/永没尘寰\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BE.80.E6.9C.9F.E4.B8.BB.E9.A2.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"往期主题\">往期主题</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\".E9.98.BF.E5.8B.92.E5.A4.AB.E5.85.8B.E5.A7.86.E9.81.97.E9.97.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"阿勒夫克姆遗闻\">阿勒夫克姆遗闻</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Banner 第三扇门.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png/600px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png/900px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png/1200px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1202\" data-file-height=\"210\" /></a>\n</p><p><b><img alt=\"Main icon.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/16px-Main_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/24px-Main_icon.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/32px-Main_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>主条目：</b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E9%98%BF%E5%8B%92%E5%A4%AB%E5%85%8B%E5%A7%86%E9%81%97%E9%97%BB\" title=\"第三扇门/阿勒夫克姆遗闻\">第三扇门/阿勒夫克姆遗闻</a>\n</p><p>上线于1.4版本。其主题是探索关于梅斯梅尔家族过往的秘密，核心谜题为“冰原滑冰”。\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E8.BD.AE.E9.BD.BF.E4.B9.8B.E5.8F.B2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"轮齿之史\">轮齿之史</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Banner 第三扇门·轮齿之史.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png/600px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png/900px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png/1200px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1202\" data-file-height=\"210\" /></a>\n</p><p><b><img alt=\"Main icon.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/16px-Main_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/24px-Main_icon.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/32px-Main_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>主条目：</b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E8%BD%AE%E9%BD%BF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%B2\" title=\"第三扇门/轮齿之史\">第三扇门/轮齿之史</a>\n</p><p>上线于1.6版本。通关【阿勒夫克姆遗闻-弃子】后即可开启，其主题是探索关于拉普拉斯科算中心和尼古拉·特斯拉的经历，核心谜题为“光线反射”。\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E5.B0.98.E7.81.B0.E4.BB.A5.E4.B8.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"尘灰以下\">尘灰以下</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Banner 第三扇门·尘灰以下.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png/600px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png/900px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png/1200px-Banner_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8%C2%B7%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1202\" data-file-height=\"210\" /></a>\n</p><p><b><img alt=\"Main icon.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/16px-Main_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/24px-Main_icon.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/32px-Main_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>主条目：</b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%89%87%E9%97%A8/%E5%B0%98%E7%81%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B\" title=\"第三扇门/尘灰